From: Lazar Gopcevic <lazgop@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:29:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(claude): resolve Claude's config dir in one place

Carried on custom until upstream PR #9617 (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR) merges; the
account work below needs it.

The session-status reader and the local session importer each rebuilt
the "$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, else ~/.claude" rule by hand, while other
paths skipped it and hardcoded ~/.claude. Give the rule one home,
including where .claude.json lives, so every caller shares it.

Signed-off-by: Lazar Gopcevic <lazgop@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4e66f92b873dbfc58da02a976d6dfa4dcc1658c2)
Signed-off-by: omni-resolve-agent[bot] <omni-resolve-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Docs: none (refactor: one helper resolves Claude's config dir; no behavior change)
